Subject: [PATCH] fct_daily_zone_revenue: add tip_rate

Tips as a share of fares, for the driver-earnings dashboard.

(Example pull request used by `make ci-local`: it modifies one mart, so
Slim CI builds only that model and its tests, deferring every upstream
reference to production.)
---
--- a/models/marts/fct_daily_zone_revenue.sql
+++ b/models/marts/fct_daily_zone_revenue.sql
@@ -10,6 +10,8 @@
     sum(total_amount) as revenue,
     sum(fare_amount) as fare_revenue,
     sum(tip_amount) as tip_revenue,
+    -- Tips as a share of fares, for the driver-earnings dashboard.
+    round(sum(tip_amount) / nullif(sum(fare_amount), 0), 4) as tip_rate,
     round(avg(trip_distance_miles), 2) as avg_trip_distance_miles
 from {{ ref('int_trips_enriched') }}
 group by pickup_date, pickup_location_id, pickup_borough, pickup_zone
